# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Lockfiles are deliberately NOT ignored. Committing package-lock.json is what
# makes an install reproducible and lets CI use `npm ci`. Ignoring it also hid a
# real problem: @ant-design/icons and prop-types were imported without being
# declared, and resolved only by accident through another package's tree.

